# Trivy ignore list (vulnerabilities and misconfiguration IDs).
# Policy: every entry needs an owner, justification, risk acceptance reference
# and an expiry date (`exp:YYYY-MM-DD`). Reviewed by @OWNER/wellnessz-security.
# Example:
# CVE-2099-00000 exp:2099-01-31  # owner: platform; not reachable (no XML parsing); RA-123
